 2. 📖 Word of the year 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Illustration: Brendan Lynch/Axios. Stock: Getty Images " Human " is Cambridge Dictionary's word of the year, reflecting the intense debate over AI and its role in our lives.

 🤖 Colin McIntosh, the dictionary's lexicographer, tells AP: "AI is changing how we talk about being human." 

 "Fears about what humans may lose when we outsource our thinking have made us reconsider the extent to which we rely on AI: from top mathematicians to teachers of young children." Go deeper . 

 
 
