 4. 🎮 1 fun thing: GTA VI gets rave reviews 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 The GTA VI trailer plays on multiple computer screens. Photo: Chris Delmas/AFP via Getty Images Grand Theft Auto VI is getting nearly flawless reviews ahead of its overnight launch, with a stunning 99/100 on score aggregator Metacritic.

 Rockstar Games' GTA VI —  the first entry in the powerhouse franchise in over a decade — is easily the year's most-anticipated video game release. Presales reportedly topped $1 billion. 🕹️ The reviewers say... 

 The Verge : "This is the GTA game the studio has been building toward for its entire existence." IGN : "Frankly, I've never played anything that's hit quite like GTA 6 — and right now I have zero plans to stop playing it." Bloomberg : "Grand Theft Auto VI is, in short, a masterpiece." Go deeper . 

 
 
